OL,3,GNEWSAAltar Stone mystery continues as
OL,4,Atheory overturned
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new study exploring the origins of
OL,7,Fthe six tonne Altar Stone at Stonehenge
OL,8,Fhas ruled out a theory that it came
OL,9,Ffrom an area of Scotland.
OL,11,FThe 4.9 metre sandstone slab within the
OL,12,Fcircle was initially believed to have
OL,13,Foriginated in Wales until a more recent
OL,14,Fstudy pointed towards it coming from
OL,15,Fnorth east Scotland.
OL,17,FScientific tests were carried out in
OL,18,Fthe Orcadian Basin area of Scotland,
OL,19,Fbut researchers failed to find a
OL,20,Flocation with the same characteristics
OL,21,Fof the stone in that area.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,438,430,260,140,0,100
