OL,3,GNEWSAAltar Stone mystery continues as
OL,4,Atheory overturned
OL,5,
OL,6,FHowever study lead, Professor Duncan
OL,7,FPirrie from the University of South
OL,8,FWales, said the latest investigation
OL,9,Fhas left them "far better equipped to
OL,10,Ffocus on the areas most likely to yield
OL,11,Fan answer."
